Files: build-gomodcache/* webui/dist/*
Copyright: (varies per vendored Go module / bundled npm package)
License: (varies per vendored Go module / bundled npm package)
Comment: This stanza is a placeholder. build-gomodcache/ (Go modules
 listed in go.sum, fetched by OBS) and webui/dist/ (vite build of webui/,
 bundling npm dependencies, built by debian/update-webui.sh) are not part of
 the upstream git tree. Before any public upload, run `licensecheck` over
 the module cache and inspect
 webui/node_modules licenses (e.g. `npx license-checker --production`), then
 replace this stanza with one Files: entry per distinct license found.

Files: build-gomodcache/github.com/restic/restic/*
Copyright: 2014 Alexander Neumann and restic contributors
License: BSD-2-Clause
Comment: restic is built from source as /usr/lib/backrest/restic, because
 backrest pins a restic version newer than the one in Debian. Its module is
 checked against the signed release tarball by debian/update-go-sum.py.

